BEGIN_DESC
TANTRA BETA 4 - Earth, MPU at KSC.
Earth, Kennedy Space Center runway: the astronavigator in her coverall, the MPU 8 m to her east.
ON FOOT: W/S walk, A/D turn, Q/E side step, Shift run, Space jump. F1 eyes / outside view.
MPU (universal mobile platform) - BETA test sample: an open 8x8 platform with a standing control post, no cabin.
It is driven only by a person at its post; the focus and the camera stay with the person.
BOARDING: walk up to the platform (anywhere round it) - F climbs onto the deck. At the console - F takes the post (again: steps back).
At the deck edge by the steps - F steps down to the ground.
DRIVING (the person's own keys): W forward (40 km/h), Shift+W full power (80 km/h), A/D steer.
S - service brake with ABS (the wheels keep turning and steering); from standstill S reverses (15 km/h).
Space - emergency brake (wheels locked, it skids). B parking brake. Caps Lock raises the deck (+0.25 m) / lowers it back.
V the platform from outside (V again - the driver's view).
PHYSICS: terramechanics of each wheel in the soil of the body it drives on (Bekker sinkage and rolling resistance,
Janosi-Hanamoto traction against slip, side force and bulldozing; Moon - lunar regolith, Mars - sand, Earth - firm loam):
grip, wheelspin, sliding and skids come out of the soil. Traction control on W, none with Shift. Independent sprung suspension
(squat on take-off, dive on braking, roll in turns), all-wheel steering (rear wheels counter-steer at low speed).
8 hub motors, 3 MW, 1 MWh battery with regenerative braking; the speed limit holds downhill too.
Speed, battery, draw and range are shown at the bottom of the screen (in the suit: in the helmet display).
Dust from the wheels (ballistic in vacuum, a cloud in air). Sound only through air (none on the Moon, faint on Mars, full on Earth).
COLLISIONS: people are struck by the platform (injuries through the suit); it meets the Tantra's legs and feet and other
platforms; a crash above 30 km/h throws the people off the deck. Parked, it stands still on its brake.
At the start the platform waits on its wheels until the terrain has loaded. Time warp above 2x: stiff suspension only; above 4x: parked.
END_DESC

